# top-level file comment
use psyche toolang.ai/reviewer
use skill briceyan/pdf-processing # inline use comment
use service github://briceyan/caps/services/github@main
use prompt https://toolang.ai/review

psyche reviewer: ```md
Prefer concrete findings and direct language.
```

service github: ```md # inline declaration header comment
---
transport: http
url: https://mcp.github.com/mcp
headers:
  Authorization: Bearer $GITHUB_TOKEN
---

Use this service when the agent needs GitHub access.
```

prompt review: ```md # inline prompt header comment
---
params: path, focus?
---

Review {{path}} carefully.
{{focus}}
```

struct ReviewFinding:
  path: string
  line: number? # inline struct field comment

struct ReviewResult:
  summary: string
  findings: ReviewFinding[]

thunk: # inline thunk header comment
  Respond directly. # inline thunk body comment

thunk summarize:
  Summarize the current workspace in a concise style.

thunk inspect() -> ReviewResult:
  Return a precise result.

thunk echo(_):
  Repeat the current message directly.

thunk review(_, path: path, focus?) -> ReviewResult:
  models = gpt-5 # inline directive comment
  psyches = reviewer, concise
  skills += review, patch
  services -= linear
  tools = shell, service_use

  Review the target carefully.

  Return a precise result.

thunk classify(style?, strict?: boolean):
  models = gpt-5
  skills = review

  Classify the current workspace in the requested style.

thunk render(style, audience?: string):
  Render the current workspace for the target audience.

thunk rewrite(_, tone?: string):
  models = gpt-5
  skills = review

  system:
    Rewrite the input for the requested tone.

  user:
    Rewrite the message faithfully.

thunk chat:
  skills += review

  system:
    Ask clarifying questions when needed.
